{"product_id":"your-royal-hostage","title":"Your Royal Hostage","description":"\u003cp\u003e\" We don't want to hurt her. We must remember that. All of us. She is after all innocent - Well, isn't she ? \" With these words the leader of the secret group tries to establish the ground rules of its conspiracy concerning the bride, HRH Princess Amy of Cumberland, a 22-year-old British Princess about to marry the somewhat older and slightly dissipated European Prince Ferdinand. But there is more than one kind of innocence, and as preperations for the Royal Wedding advance, the group evidently has in mind some gesture which will call attention to the rights and wrongs of those who have no voice of their own. \".\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 0 x 0\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Antonia Fraser\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780749306861\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 256\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45252481450137,"sku":"16RA-3-9780749306861","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67e28888e3cda_Your_20Royal_20Hostage_20Antonia_20Fraser.jpg?v=1743093791","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/your-royal-hostage","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}